<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns both secondary auctions.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns both secondary auctions.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has assigned both auctions whereby it sought to drain 1.579 billion pesos from the secondary market on Monday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM     AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    1.200 bln  9 days   24.81 pct</p>
<p>	379 million  1 day    24.27 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
